OL,3,GNEWSASchool hit in series of linked    
OL,4,Acopper thefts                          
OL,6,FA joint investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fby Warwickshire Police and West        
OL,8,FMidlands Police following a series of  
OL,9,Fcopper thefts at sites in Nuneaton and 
OL,10,FCoventry.                              
OL,12,FCroft Junior School in Nuneaton was    
OL,13,Fforced to close last week after copper 
OL,14,Fwas stolen from an outbuilding on the  
OL,15,Fpremises, leaving the school without   
OL,16,Fheating or water.                      
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
