OL,3,GNEWSASchool hit in series of linked    
OL,4,Acopper thefts                          
OL,6,FThe school confirmed it was the second 
OL,7,Ftime in the past 18 months that it had 
OL,8,Fbeen targeted by copper thieves. In the
OL,9,Flatest incident, they stole copper from
OL,10,Fair-conditioning units installed only  
OL,11,Fweeks earlier, during the half-term    
OL,12,Fholiday.                               
OL,14,FPolice confirmed the offences were     
OL,15,Fbeing treated as part of a connected   
OL,16,Fseries of copper thefts across both    
OL,17,Fforce areas.                           
